	"tips": "・Long-term Resident visa is for **foreign nationals in special circumstances** such as stepchildren, refugees, or those remaining after divorce/death\n\n・Covers **various humanitarian and family situations** not covered by other visa categories\n\n・Check the latest application requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n・**Individual circumstances heavily influence** required documentation and approval criteria\n\n・Requires strong **financial stability and guarantorship** from Japanese citizens or permanent residents",
